WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:00.834
♪♪

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.543
(Barking)

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:03.754
♪♪

00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:06.340
Finch is the last man on Earth,
maybe.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.008
Tom Hanks:
There's hints of other people
out there,

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.304
Tom Hanks:
but as far as his part of 
metropolitan St. Louis,

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:13.472
he's the only guy left.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:15.641
♪♪

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.935
But he has the greatest
companion in the world.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.979
Tom Hanks:
He has a dog, Goodyear.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:21.897
(Barking)

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.815
Hey, I missed you.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:30.322
Tom Hanks:
Finch is an engineer and he has
built a robot to help take care of Goodyear.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:32.324
Tom Hanks:
His name is Jeff.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:33.867
Jeff:
Hello, dog.

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.494
Finch:
You have a friend!

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:37.955
When word of this massive storm
comes on,

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:40.707
Tom Hanks:
they gotta pile into the family RV
and take off

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.750
♪♪

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.585
Tom Hanks:
to the the promise land out
west.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:44.795
♪♪

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:45.462
(Car horn honking)

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:48.507
Jeff:
San Francisco, here we come.

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:49.883
♪♪

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.176
It is not human to be alone,

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:51.885
♪♪

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.554
Tom Hanks:
because in company we find
companionship...

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.140
Jeff:
I believe in you, Finch.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.308
...we find love. 

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:01.478
Do you understand how important
this dog is to me?

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:02.396
Jeff:
Yes.

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:05.148
The bond between Finch and
Goodyear...

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:06.275
(Puppy whining)

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:08.610
Tom Hanks:
...is one that is based on
deep affection,

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.320
♪♪

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.197
Tom Hanks:
and constant understanding.

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:13.365
♪♪
(Tap, tap, tap)

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:15.242
Who doesn't love a good dog?

00:01:15.242 --> 00:01:16.576
Tom Hanks:
Even Jeff loves a good dog.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.912
(Barking)

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.205
What's all the fuss?

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:24.084
Jeff:
I thought our communication
might improve if I learned to talk dog.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.294
(Growling)

00:01:25.294 --> 00:01:26.420
♪♪

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.588
The beautiful thing about the
film

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.674
is that it's optimistic,

00:01:30.674 --> 00:01:31.758
♪♪

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:32.509
hopeful,

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:34.594
♪♪

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:36.305
and it's just delightful.

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:37.389
Jeff:
Come on, boy.

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:38.015
What do you think?

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:38.515
(Dog whimper)

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:39.766
(Barking)

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.811
♪♪

